  "prefLabel": "Lot 7209.04 MEAL Requirements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lot 7209.04 MEAL Requirements.\n\n(a) Each EGD shall have and each individual who gains entry to the device shall complete a MEAL.\n\n(b) The MEAL shall document:\n\n(1) The serial number or other unique ID of the device being entered;\n\n(2) The identification of the individual who entered the device;\n\n(3) The date and time of entry;\n\n(4) The duration of entry;\n\n(5) The reason for entry; and\n\n(6) Activity while entered, including the specific areas accessed and changes made.\n\n(c) Entries in the MEAL shall not be required when removing a stacker or drop box from gaming equipment during normal drop procedures.\n\n(d) The game operator shall retain the MEAL for a period of 2 years from the date of the last entry and make it available to the commission upon request.\n\nSource. #14503, eff 2-4-26, EXPIRES: 2-4-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/lot7200.html"
